# Publication policy: source and small evidence stay in Git; bulk evidence uses
# publication/artifacts.json and checked release archives. Do not add broad
# *.pkl, *.zip, *.bin, vendor/, *.out, or data/ rules.
# Generated non-Git paths below were derived from publication dispositions
# and checked against the exact current Git allowlist before first staging.
# Ignore rules are defense in depth; publication must stage audited literal paths.

